OL,4,BBearman to continue with Haas in 2027  
OL,5,GBritain's Oliver Bearman will continue 
OL,6,Gto race for the Haas team in Formula 1 
OL,7,Gin 2027.                               
OL,9,FThe US-based team announced the 21-    
OL,10,Fyear-old's new deal on Thursday, at    
OL,11,Fthe start of the Qatar Grand Prix      
OL,12,Fweekend.                               
OL,14,FIt marks Bearman's third full season   
OL,15,Fwith Haas, for whom he first raced for 
OL,16,Ftwo one-off events in 2024 before      
OL,17,Fbecoming a full-time driver in 2025.   
OL,19,FThe announcement ends a protracted     
OL,20,Fnegotiation period in which Bearman's  
OL,21,Fmanagement were seeking reassurances   
OL,22,Fabout his future from Ferrari.         
